title <size:24>Deployment View: Agentic Platform (local) - Laptop</size>\n<size:24>Where each container actually runs — and the two host-boundary gotchas that cost real debugging time.</size>

set separator none
left to right direction
skinparam ranksep 20
skinparam nodesep 5
hide stereotype

